    { "a": "RBF", "t": "baseline", "aka": ["gaussian", "squared exponential", "SE", "radial basis function", "exponentiated quadratic", "gaussian RBF", "normal kernel", "RBFKernel"], "q": "exp(−γ‖x−y‖²). The SVM default, with an infinite-dimensional feature space." },
